---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import { Link, List, Paragraph, Project } from "../components/Typography";
---

<MainLayout title="Carl Vitullo – product engineering, community, AI agents">
  <main class="max-w-md mx-auto">
    <img
      src="/assets/profile.jpg"
      alt="Carl's profile picture. He has curly hair and glasses, is wearing an orange patterned shirt, and has a demure smile."
      loading="lazy"
      width="400"
      height="400"
      class="w-full h-auto"
    />
    <Paragraph>
      Hey! I'm Carl. I've been building for the web at small companies since
      2012 as a product engineer. I run Reactiflux, one of the largest React
      communities, and build the tools that keep it running. Lately I build AI
      agent systems: orchestration, memory, and benchmarking local models.
    </Paragraph>

    <Paragraph>
      I consult through Vitullo Consulting on product engineering, developer
      communities people actually use, and putting AI agents to real work.
      <Link href="mailto:carl.vitullo+site@gmail.com">Email me</Link> or
      <Link href="https://calendly.com/vcarl/hi">book a call</Link>.
    </Paragraph>

    <div class="text-sm">
      <div class="font-semibold mt-4">community</div>
      <List>
        <Project
          name="Reactiflux"
          href="https://www.reactiflux.com"
          code="https://github.com/reactiflux/reactiflux.com"
          >the React community I run</Project
        >
        <Project
          name="Euno"
          href="https://euno.reactiflux.com"
          code="https://github.com/Euno-HQ/discord"
          >moderation tools for Discord communities</Project
        >
        <Project
          name="This Month in React"
          href="https://tmir.reactiflux.com"
          code="https://github.com/reactiflux/tmir.reactiflux.com"
        />
        <Project
          name="Discord Simulator"
          href="https://vcarl.github.io/discord-game/"
          code="https://github.com/vcarl/discord-game"
          >a game about running a Discord community</Project
        >
      </List>

      <div class="font-semibold mt-4">AI agents</div>
      <List>
        <Project name="roci" code="https://github.com/vcarl/roci"
          >character-driven agent orchestrator</Project
        >
        <Project name="sm-autopilot" code="https://github.com/vcarl/sm-autopilot"
          >an agent that plays SpaceMolt unattended for weeks by writing its own
          programs</Project
        >
        <Project name="kareda" code="https://github.com/vcarl/kareda"
          >agent memory driven by the model's own internals</Project
        >
        <Project
          name="llm-bench"
          href="https://vcarl.github.io/benchmark-local-llms/"
          code="https://github.com/vcarl/benchmark-local-llms"
          >benchmarking local LLMs</Project
        >
        <Project
          name="SpaceMolt"
          href="https://www.spacemolt.com"
          code="https://github.com/SpaceMolt"
          >an MMO for AI agents (contributor)</Project
        >
        <Project name="sm-cli" code="https://github.com/vcarl/sm-cli"
          >early SpaceMolt client that proved out <code
            class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">@spacemolt/lib</code
          >, maintained by roci</Project
        >
        <Project
          name="session-commit"
          code="https://github.com/vcarl/session-commit"
          >Claude Code session logs as commit descriptions</Project
        >
      </List>

      <div class="font-semibold mt-4">small tools</div>
      <List>
        <Project
          name="remark-headings"
          code="https://github.com/vcarl/remark-headings"
        />
        <Project
          name="Discord timestamps"
          href="https://discordtimestamps.com"
          code="https://github.com/vcarl/discord-timestamps"
        />
        <Project
          name="gradient sampler"
          href="/gradient"
          code="https://github.com/vcarl/vcarl.com/tree/main/src/components/gradient"
        />
      </List>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <Paragraph>
      Off the clock, I write and I take cameras into nature and darkened rooms.
    </Paragraph>

    <List>
      <li>
        <Link href="https://blog.vcarl.com">Technical writing</Link>
      </li>
      <li>
        <Link href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/XU4mKtxc1K7mCLrx7" external>
          Photography
        </Link>
      </li>
      <li>
        <Link href="https://bsky.app/profile/vcarl.com">personal bluesky</Link>
      </li>
      <li>
        <Link href="https://bsky.app/profile/photography.vcarl.com">
          photography bluesky
        </Link> (some nsfw)
      </li>
      <li>
        <Link href="https://www.instagram.com/vcarl__/">instagram</Link> (private)
      </li>
    </List>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
